NAME = Apixaban_Explicit4DMSO_r2SCAN3c_SinglePoint_KeepDens.inp
|  1> # Apixaban + Explicit 4x DMSO: r2SCAN-3c SinglePoint (KeepDens) on the
|  2> #   XTB2-optimized structure
|  3> # Starting geometry: the converged XTB2 Opt result of
|  4> #   Apixaban_Explicit4DMSO_XTB2_Opt.out (E_XTB2 = -155.788358 Eh; fully
|  5> #   converged, no warnings), which was itself the XTB2 re-optimization of
|  6> #   the r2SCAN-3c/SMD(DMSO)-optimized Explicit4 structure
|  7> #   (Apixaban_Explicit4DMSO_repositioned_SMD_DMSO_Opt_KeepDens.out,
|  8> #   E_r2SCAN-3c = -3754.770760516310 Eh).
|  9> #
| 10> # Purpose: evaluate the r2SCAN-3c electronic energy (and density, via
| 11> #   KeepDens) at the XTB2-relaxed geometry, without re-optimizing at the DFT
| 12> #   level - lets the two levels of theory (r2SCAN-3c-optimized vs
| 13> #   XTB2-optimized geometry) be compared directly at the r2SCAN-3c energy
| 14> #   level.
| 15> #
| 16> # No SMD/solvent model here, matching the other gas-phase-style single
| 17> #   points used in this project for Explicit-solvent structures (e.g.
| 18> #   Apixaban/DMSO/MD/10/XTB2Opt/Apixaban_10DMSO_r2SCAN3c_SinglePoint_KeepDens.inp).
| 19> 
| 20> ! r2SCAN-3c TightSCF KeepDens
